  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - Twenty years old and you already know how to do all that? Nice work.
  - Did you seriously not notice that my brother is ignoring you?
  - "He\u2019s ignoring you too."
  - What do you even want from him?
  - "What do both of you want from me? I\u2019m working."
  - "I\u2019m not tolerating weird behavior or this kind of clinginess in my squad.
    She\u2019s just pestering you\u2026"
  - "Look who\u2019s talking\u2026"
  - "Shhh\u2026 keep it down\u2026 Did you forget? What if Serh\u2014.....Beast heard
    you?"
  - Heard what?
  - "That you\u2019re VERY CUTE."
  - ' *whispering*: Now what do you think? Did he heard me?'
  - "\u2026\u2026\u2026.........................."
  - "Oh god\u2026"
